# admin - deploy/env/admin.env (copy from this file; never commit the real one).
# Only what admin reads at runtime and compose does NOT set. Compose already sets the wiring
# (ports, DATABASE_URL, REDIS_*, RABBITMQ_URL, *_GRPC_URL, JWT_*, SERVICE_CLIENT_SECRET) from deploy/.env.
# Empty KEY= lines are required values; commented lines are optional tunables with their default.

# Optional: directory the admin log watcher tails inside the container.
# LOGS_DIR=/var/log/kmaedu
